omakasui-archive-keyring (1.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Move the source to github.com/omakasui/keyrings; keys are shipped from
    the repository instead of being fetched at build time.
  * Split into one keyring per repository: omakasui-archive-keyring now
    ships only omakasui-packages.gpg, omakasui-core-archive-keyring ships
    omakasui-core.gpg.

